WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Soundproofing shop gives away tool kits for free

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,600
The Shilai diesel stocked at the counter is yours too

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,200
Diesel, you have a way to get it?

4
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:11,350
Call this number and tell me your name. It's 20% cheaper than outside.

5
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:13,150
It’s hard to get loose oil, so you have to go this way

6
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:15,550
No matter how many offerings he has on hand, I want them all

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,700
I’ll buy a piece of goods worth one million and send them to my warehouse tomorrow.

8
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:24,110
Diesel becomes more expensive as time passes. Gas stations do not sell it in bulk.

9
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:35,730
It will never break and you won’t even need to repair it in the future.

10
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:38,730
Now that the store is here, it’s time to provide Internet access to the circle outside.

11
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:43,230
While I could still shop online, I stocked up a batch in the first two days.

12
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:44,630
Forty or fifty will be installed first.
